  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "Passive: extend knock up and fire tracking shots; Active: arc AoE knock up, then sustained volleys scaling with ATK SPD",
    "skill1": "Passive: battle-start Soaring (invincible); dives at airborne enemies to mark prey; stuns marked prey after landing",
    "skill2": "Passive: zone ally haste stacks on prey marks; self absorbs doubled haste after aerial phase; Active: line AoE knock up",
    "skill3": "battle ATK SPD increase",
    "skill4": "normal attacks bonus damage on marked prey; periodic max HP-based true damage with knock up",
    "skill5": "knock up stationary rearmost enemy after aerial start; ATK SPD and Energy on prey marks or defeats"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Kazim]] opens **invincible in Soaring**, diving at airborne enemies to **mark prey** and stunning them after he lands. His ultimate chains **arc knock-ups** into sustained volleys that scale with attack speed. Marked prey takes **bonus normal-attack damage** and periodic max-HP true damage with knock-up. Allies in his zone gain **Haste stacks from prey marks**, which he can absorb doubled after his aerial phase. He shines when **enemies can be kept airborne or marked** for follow-up focus. Fights with **grounded, spread, or knock-up-immune targets** deny his mark loop and aerial payoff.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Kazim]] opens **invincible and untargetable in Soaring** for about 10s \u2014 do not dump burst into that window. He marks airborne prey, then lands into stun volleys and team Haste from marks; after Soaring ends, punish with mid-fight [[Gwyneth]] or lasting [[Shemira]] coverage \u2014 not opener assassins into the air. Blunt knock-up with [[filter:steadfast]] like [[Igor]] or [[Gunnar]], and [[filter:unaffected]] like [[Shakir]] or [[Sylphira]] during his volley windows."
}
